{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35781","headline":"闻泉 · 李咸用","name":"闻泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淅淅梦初惊，幽窗枕簟清。\n更无人共听，秪有月空明。\n急想穿岩曲，低应过石平。\n欲将琴强写，不是自然声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「闻泉」条，撰者任国绪、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"任国绪"}